PPC SB+lwsyncs
"POWER's lightweight barrier lwsync does NOT order store->load, so SB+lwsync is
 allowed on POWER. ARMv7 has no lwsync: its only general barrier (dmb) is a full
 barrier that forbids SB. This instruction-level asymmetry is the practical
 source of ARM/POWER incomparability -- on the common instruction set herd's
 arm.cat and ppc.cat coincide on every test we swept (see README)."
{ 0:r2=x; 0:r4=y; 1:r2=y; 1:r4=x; }
 P0           | P1            ;
 li r1,1      | li r1,1       ;
 stw r1,0(r2) | stw r1,0(r2)  ;
 lwsync       | lwsync        ;
 lwz r3,0(r4) | lwz r3,0(r4)  ;
exists (0:r3=0 /\ 1:r3=0)
